/tmp/paper2505.00298.atjZCp/src/main.tex:401:%Based on this Lemma, we will show the following. For symmetric digraphs $D$ and any fixed integer $k\geq 3$, the problem of determining whether $\tau_{S,r}(D)\geq \ell~(\ell\geq 1)$ is NP-complete for $|S|\subseteq V(D)$ with $|S|=k$ and $r\in S$. Note that the proof of the following theorem is similar to the Theorem 3.6 in \cite{Sun-Yeo}. For completeness, we give the proof here.
