/tmp/paper2505.00298.atjZCp/src/main.tex:529:    Let $D$ be a symmetric digraph and $S\subseteq V(D)$ with $|S|=k$ ($k$ is part of the input) and $r\in S$. Let $\ell\geq 2$ be a fixed integer. The problem of deciding if $\tau_{S,r}(D)\geq \ell$ is NP-complete.
