+    "intuition_description": (
+        "View every edge-terminal as a not-all-equal constraint and propagate "
+        "a forced colour whenever two vertices of an edge agree; without "
+        "successful branching, the solver faces the full two-colour partition space."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track A: Theorem 2.6 proves NP-completeness on symmetric digraphs "
+        "for the exact regime used here, ell=2 fixed and k=|S| part of the "
+        "input; at the shipping regular planted regime n=198, degree=6, "
+        "the domain-standard NAE-DPLL search with unit propagation exhausted "
