codex
The finished generator passes every local gate, including a post-edit 12/12 G1 recheck and a verified \(n=256\) cap-bound escalation. The only unresolved requirement is external: all 12 oracle draws across bare, structural, and placebo runs were rejected by OpenRouter before model inference. I’m finalizing the artifact inventory with that limitation preserved rather than turning service errors into false hardness evidence.
The module, local gate report, README, and all three harness-owned transcripts are complete. The required oracle commands were run, but OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 on every redraw, so the artifacts honestly record an unavailable oracle verdict.
  ✓ Read the full paper and triage G/H/V, including exact parameters and certificate cost
  ✓ Inspect repository helpers and hardening/submit contracts
  ✓ Design and implement the generator or write a justified rejection
  ✓ Run self-tests, attacks, canonicalization checks, and fix issues
  ✓ Run the required oracle and G9 arms, then write final artifacts and README
