- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2505.00298/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The result is not yet submission-ready: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” for all bare, hinted, and placebo oracle draws. The transcripts record these as service errors, so no false hardened verdict or rejection was issued.
