65:    In this paper, we first completely determine the computational complexity for the decision version of IDPSTP on Eulerian digraphs and symmetric digraphs. We then show that, for any $\epsilon>0$, given an instance of IDPSTP with order $n$, it is NP-hard to approximate the solution within $O(n^{{1/3}-\epsilon})$. 
